{"id":"n84467-1-8","stage":5,"title":"풍족하다 · 丰足","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84467-1-8-1","ko":"지수는 집이 부자인가 봐.","zh":"智秀家好像很有钱吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}},{"text":"집이","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집이","audio":"/audio/0f403a24bdd427c70421.mp3"}},{"text":"부자인가","meaning":"富翁，富豪，富人","explanation":"부자：富翁，富豪，富人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"부자","audio":"/audio/2d4b9735cbc268247e90.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59725","senseId":"1","lemma":"부자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부자인가","audio":"/audio/6b342793dac22fe76544.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"2d4b9735cbc26824","term":"부자","zh":"富翁，富豪，富人","audio":"/audio/2d4b9735cbc268247e90.mp3","entryId":"59725","definition":"财产丰厚、生活富足的人。","pronunciation":["부ː자"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c8cc1aa73f197803bb7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84467-1-8-2","ko":"응, 어렸을 때부터 풍족하게 자라 왔다고 들었어.","zh":"嗯，我听说她从小时候起就生活在富裕的环境里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年幼、年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年幼、年龄小；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렸을","audio":"/audio/314f3a56783f02be9cd3.mp3"}},{"text":"때부터","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때부터","audio":"/audio/0afde5432108ccb6dc1b.mp3"}},{"text":"풍족하게","meaning":"丰足，充足，富裕","explanation":"풍족하다：丰足，充足，富裕；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"풍족하다","audio":"/audio/bee2578e00069f5733ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84467","senseId":"1","lemma":"풍족하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풍족하게","audio":"/audio/fc2106ee612e9e5eb5d8.mp3"}},{"text":"자라","meaning":"生长，成长","explanation":"자라다：生长，成长；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"자라다","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66317","senseId":"2","lemma":"자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자라","audio":"/audio/c893b8d3522e64f616f7.mp3"}},{"text":"왔다고","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔다고","audio":"/audio/34108fd181a9dae210db.mp3"}},{"text":"들었어.","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었어","audio":"/audio/212b440366b02768c97f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年幼、年龄小","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"bee2578e00069f57","term":"풍족하다","zh":"丰足，充足，富裕","audio":"/audio/bee2578e00069f5733ff.mp3","entryId":"84467","definition":"非常丰富，没有不足。","pronunciation":["풍조카다"]},{"id":"17c36cbe99642c8e","term":"자라다","zh":"生长，成长","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3","entryId":"66317","definition":"在某种环境过背景下长大。","pronunciation":["자라다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，传来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"消息或联系等被转达给某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/78f1606f7679040435c1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84467","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.4167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，我听说她从小时候起就生活在富裕的环境里。","今天有位学长